  "notes": "USAGE:\nUsed as a suru verb ({迎撃|げいげき}する). Common in military and defense contexts, and frequently appears in news about missile defense systems.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {迎撃|げいげき}ミサイル (interceptor missile)\n- {迎撃|げいげき}システム (interception system)\n- {迎撃|げいげき}する (to intercept)\n- ミサイル{迎撃|げいげき} (missile interception)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {撃退|げきたい}: repelling, driving back — focuses on forcing retreat\n- {防衛|ぼうえい}: defense — broader concept of defense",
